.TH SDE-GALLERY 1 "October 2026" "SDE" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sde-gallery \- browse the photo library on the SDE desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sde-gallery
[--version | --help]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Gallery shows the pictures in your XDG Pictures folder (see
.BR xdg-user-dir (1))
and in folders you add, grouped by month of their modification time.
The sidebar offers All Photos, Favorites, Recent (the last 30 days),
Screenshots (the Screenshots folder inside Pictures) and the folder list.
JPEG, PNG, GIF, BMP and SVG files are shown; WebP and TIFF are shown when
the matching gdk-pixbuf loaders are installed.
.PP
Thumbnails are made in the background and shared with other applications
through the freedesktop.org thumbnail cache in
.IR ~/.cache/thumbnails/normal
and
.IR ~/.cache/thumbnails/large .
.PP
Double-click a photo or press Enter to open the viewer. It offers zoom,
fit, view rotation, a slideshow and a details panel, and these actions:
Favorite, Edit in Photo
.RB ( sde-view ),
Open With Other Application
.RB ( xdg-open ),
Set as Wallpaper, Show in Files
.RB ( liria ),
Copy Path and Move to Trash
.RB ( "gio trash" ).
Files are never deleted permanently.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B Arrows, Page Up/Down, Home, End
Move between photos. Shift extends the selection.
.TP
.B Ctrl+click, Shift+click, Space, Ctrl+A, Esc
Select photos, select all, clear the selection.
.TP
.B Enter
Open the viewer.
.TP
.B + \- , Ctrl+mouse wheel
Change the thumbnail size (zoom in the viewer).
.TP
.B Ctrl+F, Ctrl+O, F5
Search, add a folder, reload the library.
.TP
.B Ctrl+D, Ctrl+C, Delete
Toggle favorite, copy paths, move to the Trash.
.TP
.B Viewer: 0, 1, R, I, F5, F11, Esc
Fit, actual size, rotate, details, slideshow, full screen, back.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.B --help
Print a short usage summary.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/sde/sde.conf
Section
.B [gallery]
keeps
.BR folders= ,
.BR favorites=
(lists separated by semicolons),
.B thumbnail_size=
and
.BR sort= .
Set as Wallpaper writes
.B wallpaper=
in
.BR [appearance] .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sde-view (1),
.BR liria (1),
.BR sde-settings (1),
.BR xdg-user-dir (1)
